--- !u!114 &297038828
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 297038826}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=100><color=red>Profile Explanation</color></size>\r\n\r\nThis part
    of the tutorial explains your profile.\r\n\r\nYour Profile is the core of your
    phone application. Everything else, whether on your phone or PC, is temporary
    and resets after each game. For example, your robot, controls, and input settings
    apply only to a single match. The only thing that persists is your profile.\r\n\r\nYour
    profile consists of four main elements: your name, your level, the option to
    watch ads for XP, and your battle history.\r\n\r\n<color=red>Name</color>\r\nThe
    first time you enter the game, you\u2019ll be prompted to choose a name. This
    name is displayed in battles, keeps your battle history organized, and determines
    your position on the leaderboard.\r\nDon\u2019t worry, you can change your name
    anytime by tapping on it in your profile.\r\n\r\n<color=red>Level & Leagues</color>\r\nYour
    level represents your progress and determines your global ranking. You gain XP
    through battles or by watching ads.\r\nAbout every 50 levels, you advance to
    a higher league, which requires more XP per level. You\u2019ll notice this change
    through a color shift in the level orb and the background brightness.\r\n\r\n<color=red>Watching
    Ads for XP</color>\r\nBelow your league info, there\u2019s a button to watch
    ads for XP. You can watch up to 10 ads per day, with each ad granting progressively
    more XP.\r\n\r\n<color=red>Battle History</color>\r\nYour battle history stores
    your last 3 matches, including results, opponent names, and both players robot
    parts. Use this to analyze strategies, improve your tactics, or just remind your
    friends of their defeat."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 32e9087bea9953c46ab22aa5c5c10950, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9016579006585588636, guid: 32e9087bea9953c46ab22aa5c5c10950, type: 2}
