  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=100><color=red>Menu Explanation</color></size>



    This part
    of the tutorial explains the game menu.



    From the menu, you can start your
    games. When you''re ready, just press <color=red>Play</color>, and the connection
    process will begin (explained in more detail in the Connection section of the
    tutorial).



    Besides this, there are two other important menu options: Global
    Leaderboard and Your Profile. The profile has more details and will be covered
    in a separate section, while the leaderboard is explained below.



    The <color=red>Global
    Leaderboard</color> displays the top 10 players worldwide, ranked by level. If
    multiple players have the same level, the one who reached it first is ranked
    higher. One thing to note: if you should appear on the leaderboard after gaining
    XP (such as from watching ads), the change won''t be visible immediately. The
    leaderboard updates only when you enter the menu.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 32e9087bea9953c46ab22aa5c5c10950, type: 2}
